    },
    {
      "number": 55,
      "category": "",
      "title": "程普傳",
      "paragraph_id": "c-sanguozhi-055-chengpu:line014",
      "count": 1,
      "raw_count": 1,
      "duplicate_count": 0,
      "counting_policy": "independent_fixed_witness_occurrences",
      "quote": "，驅馬疾呼，以矛突賊，賊披，策因隨出。後拜盪寇中郎將，領零陵太守，從討劉勳於尋陽，進攻黃祖於沙羨，還鎮石城。",
      "paragraph_ids": [
        "c-sanguozhi-055-chengpu:line014"
      ],
